The legal text in this repository is the official text of the Конституция на Република България (Constitution of
the Republic of Bulgaria), as published by the Народно събрание на Република България (National Assembly of the
Republic of Bulgaria) in its consolidated text at https://www.parliament.bg/bg/const. Source of the text and of
every date and reference: the National Assembly of the Republic of Bulgaria and the Държавен вестник (State Gazette).

Official legal texts are not subject to copyright in Bulgaria (Закон за авторското право и сродните му права,
чл. 4, т. 1). Lexifina makes no claim to the legal text.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was split into one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line; HTML
markup was removed and spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised. The wording of the law and the National
Assembly's amendment notes were not changed. The National Assembly does not endorse this repository.

This repository is not an official publication. Only the texts published by the National Assembly and in the State
Gazette are authoritative.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

To the extent possible under law, Lexifina has waived all copyright and related or neighbouring rights to this work.
